# stochasticritic.github.io

This repo is a **Jekyll** site using the **al-folio** theme (academic/homepage theme for GitHub Pages).

## Stack

- **Jekyll** – static site generator
- **Liquid** – templating in layouts and includes
- **Markdown** – content in `_pages/`, blog posts
- **HTML/CSS/JS** – in `assets/`, layouts, and generated output

## Key paths

- `_config.yml` – Jekyll config (site title, baseurl, plugins, etc.)
- `_pages/` – Markdown pages (home, about, etc.)
- `assets/` – CSS, JS, images, PDFs (`assets/img/`, `assets/css/`, `assets/js/`, `assets/pdf/`)
- `blog/` – blog post output (often generated from `_posts/` in source)
- `index.html`, `publications/`, `projects/`, `teaching/`, `cv/` – main sections

## Conventions

- Edit content in Markdown where possible; use Liquid only when needed.
- Images: prefer WebP variants in `assets/img/` (e.g. `*-480.webp`, `*-800.webp`).
- Keep al-folio theme structure in mind when changing layouts or styles.
